<TXSPN>"Hello?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, um, this is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone. I'm with the Motoki Police―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hearing those words, I hung up right away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was the moment my last hope was cut off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone: the one who answered it was, for some reason, someone from the police.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "悲しみに包まれて.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">So that's it. It really is so, after all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">My mouth trembled, and the backs of my eyes grew hot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In my hand, my phone, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cold hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The feel of that cold hand gave my heart something to brace against.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I mustn't cry, I mustn't cry now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I absolutely mustn't cry in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just for now...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">, it's fine, okay? Going back, even now. This is just me being selfish..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hard to make out and without inflection, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed she had no strength left even to raise her voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I've already decided. I won't leave you, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>. It's okay, you don't have to worry about anything."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
